cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EdgeBench Verified: a re-verification of the 51 public EdgeBench tasks"
message: "If you use these decisions, findings or repaired task versions, please cite this repository and the original EdgeBench."
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
authors:
  - name: "EdgeBench Verified contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/findalexli/edgebench-verified"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An independent re-verification of the 51 publicly released EdgeBench tasks. Every task has a
  decision (retain with note, repair as a new version, or exclude), every repair passed paired
  before/after runs of the original and repaired evaluator on the same inputs (repeated three
  times, no verdict changes), and formal checks (Lean 4, TLA+) back several findings.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "EdgeBench"
    authors:
      - name: "ByteDance Seed"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/EdgeBench"
